+// Release C «Карьера и отделение 2.0» (Claude, 12.10.2026). A long campaign with understandable growth.
+//  · Задача смены: a career officer from the rank «Сержант» (runs the shift, PPA «välijuht») or the chief
+//    sets the focus of the shift at the briefing: balanced, prevention, fast response or road safety.
+//  · Аттестация: every six months the officer gets a service review (PPA development interview) with a
+//    grade, a premium and consequences.
+//  · Жизнь вне службы: from time to time a real-life situation needs a decision (a sick child, a broken
+//    car, a wedding, a side job that needs the employer's permission, a «favour» for a neighbour).
+//  · Мэрия: at every month close the chief meets the city: ask for money, promise results, or report.
+//  · Моральный дух: department morale from stress, fatigue, complaints and support; at very low morale
+//    exhausted officers resign — the PPA really is short of front-line staff (ERR: 200–300 people).
+//  · Рынок кандидатов: new applicants every month, not a fixed list.
+//  · Полицейский года: the year closes with a summary and an award.
